关于20 decay，主要就是降turnover
模板就参考我文章里面的代码做替换，比如if_else的
night = open/ts_delay(close, 1) - 1;
drop_hc = high/close - 1;
rise_lc = low/close - 1;
rise_ho = high/open - 1;
drop_lo = low/open - 1;
over_drop = abs(drop_hc) + abs(drop_lo);
over_rise = abs(rise_lc) + abs(rise_ho);
if_else(sign(night) > 0, over_drop, -over_rise)
可以把night或者over_drop、-over_rise替换成别的，可能有用，我还没有深入探索这个模板￣□￣｜｜
